cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ExWDIT in research or documentation, please cite it as below."
title: "ExWDIT: Executable / Digital Investigation and Behavioral Analysis Toolkit"
type: software
abstract: >-
  ExWDIT is an open-source C++20 desktop forensic analysis suite (Dear ImGui)
  that combines static PE analysis, runtime behavior monitoring, evidence-based
  risk scoring, and investigation reporting for malware analysis, digital
  forensics, and anti-cheat investigation.
authors:
  - name: "ExWDIT Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nekx86/ExWDIT"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - digital forensics
  - malware analysis
  - PE analysis
  - behavioral analysis
  - reverse engineering
  - anti-cheat
  - YARA
  - C++20
  - Dear ImGui
date-released: "2026-10-06"
